  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vPnQvVG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1151\" height=\"327\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Malumian Crates</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>與 Malum 無任何關聯</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組需要同時安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apple-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apple Crates</a> &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Malum</a> 才能正常運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 CurseForge Launcher 下載將自動為您完成此步驟。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;__________________________________________________________________________________</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>一般資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Apple Crates 是一款新增功能性木箱的模組，您可以在其中存放物品並開設商店。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此擴充模組僅新增相容於 Malum 的新木箱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增的木箱類型如下：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Runewood</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Soulwood</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
